# QA output and local working notes.
#
# Screenshots and audit runs are regenerated on demand and are worth tens of
# megabytes a session. Carrying them in the repository made every QA pass a
# commit, and every commit a remote build. They belong in a CI artifact or an
# object store instead; docs/releases.md records where.
#
# History is left alone: these paths were tracked before, so old blobs stay in
# the object database. This only stops new ones arriving.
audits/
artifacts/
tmp/
wiki/
